    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-30701\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"108\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-30701)\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"16\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-30701)\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"119\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">x</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"13\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">y</text><rect x=\"70\" y=\"40\" width=\"60\" height=\"44\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d9dee7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"70.0\" y1=\"106.0\" x2=\"70.0\" y2=\"110.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"118\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">a</text><line x1=\"130.0\" y1=\"106.0\" x2=\"130.0\" y2=\"110.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"118\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">b</text><line x1=\"28.0\" y1=\"84.0\" x2=\"32.0\" y2=\"84.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"25\" y=\"86.5\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">c</text><line x1=\"28.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"32.0\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"25\" y=\"42.5\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">d</text><line x1=\"70.0\" y1=\"108.0\" x2=\"70.0\" y2=\"84.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"130.0\" y1=\"108.0\" x2=\"130.0\" y2=\"84.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"30.0\" y1=\"84.0\" x2=\"70.0\" y2=\"84.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"30.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"70.0\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><text x=\"133\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">+F(b,d)</text><text x=\"133\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">\u2212F(b,c)</text><text x=\"66\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">\u2212F(a,d)</text><text x=\"66\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">+F(a,c)</text><text x=\"189.2\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">\u2119(a &lt; X \u2264 b,</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">c &lt; Y \u2264 d)</text><text x=\"185.04\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">= four corners</text><text x=\"170.48000000000002\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">with signs + \u2212 \u2212 +</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">F(x,y) = \u2119(X \u2264 x, Y \u2264 y)</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "The (wait x, ride y) plane. The shaded rectangle (a, b] \u00d7 (c, d] has chance F(b,d) \u2212 F(a,d) \u2212 F(b,c) + F(a,c): the corner values with signs + \u2212 \u2212 +.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>Joint CDF:</strong> $F_{X,Y}(x, y) \\triangleq \\mathbb{P}(X \\le x, Y \\le y)$ evaluates the cumulative measure of infinite lower-left quadrant $(-\\infty, x] \\times (-\\infty, y]$.",
      "<strong>2D Rectangle Measure:</strong> Probability in $(a, b] \\times (c, d]$ is $\\mathbb{P}(a \\lt  X \\le b, c \\lt  Y \\le d) = F(b, d) - F(a, d) - F(b, c) + F(a, c) \\ge 0$.",
      "<strong>2-Monotonicity Axiom:</strong> Increasing in $x$ and $y$ separately is NOT enough! The 2D cross-difference must be non-negative for every rectangle."
    ],
    "math": "$$\\mathbb{P}(a \\lt  X \\le b, c \\lt  Y \\le d) = F_{X,Y}(b, d) - F_{X,Y}(a, d) - F_{X,Y}(b, c) + F_{X,Y}(a, c) \\ge 0$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>Wait and ride on one plane.</strong> Each morning is one point: how long you waited and how long you rode. The CDF at a point says how much of the plane lies to its lower left; a rectangle of pairs needs four such corners.",
    "examTrap": "Assuming coordinate-wise monotonicity guarantees a valid 2D CDF. Functions exist where \u2202F/\u2202x \u2265 0 and \u2202F/\u2202y \u2265 0, yet the rectangle measure evaluates to a negative number!",
    "stmtKind": "DEFINITION",
    "statement": "<b>Joint CDF.</b> For random variables $X,Y$ on the same space, $F_{X,Y}(x,y)=\\mathbb P(X\\le x,\\,Y\\le y)$. It is non-decreasing in each variable, right-continuous, tends to $0$ as either argument $\\to-\\infty$ and to $1$ as both $\\to\\infty$, and for $a\\lt b$, $c\\lt d$: $\\mathbb P(a\\lt X\\le b,\\,c\\lt Y\\le d)=F_{X,Y}(b,d)-F_{X,Y}(a,d)-F_{X,Y}(b,c)+F_{X,Y}(a,c)\\ge0$ (Ross 6.1; Grimmett 4.5).",
    "hint": "Wait and ride together: how do you get the chance of a rectangle of (wait, ride) pairs from the joint CDF alone?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$F_{X,Y}(x,y)=\\mathbb P(X\\le x,Y\\le y)$ = both at most their limits.</strong> The chance that the wait is at most $x$ and the ride at most $y$ at once.",
      "<strong>$F(b,d)-F(a,d)-F(b,c)+F(a,c)$ = the rectangle by inclusion\u2013exclusion.</strong> Take the big corner, remove the two strips beyond $a$ and $c$, and add back the doubly removed corner.",
      "<strong>$\\ge0$ = the rectangle rule is part of the definition.</strong> Being increasing in each variable is not enough; this four-corner combination must also be non-negative."
    ],
