    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-30806\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"20\" y=\"41\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">route 1: \u03bb\u2081</text><line x1=\"88\" y1=\"38\" x2=\"168\" y2=\"38\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"168.0\" y=\"35.3\" width=\"16.8\" height=\"7.7\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"170.1\" y=\"36.7\" width=\"3.5\" height=\"2.8\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"175.0\" y=\"36.7\" width=\"3.5\" height=\"2.8\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"179.9\" y=\"36.7\" width=\"3.5\" height=\"2.8\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><circle cx=\"171.5\" cy=\"43.0\" r=\"1.4\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"181.3\" cy=\"43.0\" r=\"1.4\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">route 2: \u03bb\u2082</text><line x1=\"88\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140.0\" y=\"59.3\" width=\"16.8\" height=\"7.7\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"142.1\" y=\"60.7\" width=\"3.5\" height=\"2.8\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"147.0\" y=\"60.7\" width=\"3.5\" height=\"2.8\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"151.9\" y=\"60.7\" width=\"3.5\" height=\"2.8\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><circle cx=\"143.5\" cy=\"67.0\" r=\"1.4\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"153.3\" cy=\"67.0\" r=\"1.4\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"89\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">route 3: \u03bb\u2083</text><line x1=\"88\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"118\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"118.0\" y=\"83.3\" width=\"16.8\" height=\"7.7\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"120.1\" y=\"84.7\" width=\"3.5\" height=\"2.8\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"125.0\" y=\"84.7\" width=\"3.5\" height=\"2.8\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"129.9\" y=\"84.7\" width=\"3.5\" height=\"2.8\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><circle cx=\"121.5\" cy=\"91.0\" r=\"1.4\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"131.3\" cy=\"91.0\" r=\"1.4\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">the first bus to arrive wins the race</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">T = min T\u1d62 ~ Exp(\u03bb\u2081 + \u03bb\u2082 + \u03bb\u2083)</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">\u2119(route k is first) = \u03bb\u2096 / \u2211\u03bb\u1d62</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">survival functions multiply: \u2119(T > t) = \u220f e^(\u2212\u03bb\u1d62t)</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "Three routes with rates \u03bb\u2081, \u03bb\u2082, \u03bb\u2083 racing to the stop. The first arrival T = min T\u1d62 is exponential with rate \u2211\u03bb\u1d62, and route k wins with chance \u03bb\u2096/\u2211\u03bb\u1d62.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>Series Setup:</strong> System of $n$ components in series with independent lifetimes $T_i \\sim \\text{Exp}(\\lambda_i)$. System fails at $T_{\\text{sys}} = \\min(T_1, \\dots, T_n)$.",
      "<strong>Survival Product:</strong> $\\mathbb{P}(T_{\\text{sys}} > t) = \\prod_{i=1}^n \\mathbb{P}(T_i > t) = \\prod_{i=1}^n e^{-\\lambda_i t} = \\exp(-(\\sum_{i=1}^n \\lambda_i) t)$.",
      "<strong>Failure Probability:</strong> The system lifetime is strictly $\\text{Exp}(\\sum_{i=1}^n \\lambda_i)$, and component $k$ is the one that causes system failure with probability $\\frac{\\lambda_k}{\\sum_{i=1}^n \\lambda_i}$."
    ],
    "math": "$$T_{\\text{sys}} = \\min_{1 \\le i \\le n} T_i \\sim \\text{Exp}\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^n \\lambda_i\\right), \\qquad \\mathbb{P}(T_k = \\min T_i) = \\frac{\\lambda_k}{\\sum_{i=1}^n \\lambda_i}$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>Three routes race.</strong> A frequent route is more likely to produce the first bus, in proportion to its rate, and having three routes makes the first arrival come sooner than any one route alone.",
    "examTrap": "Attempting convolution integration to find the minimum of lifetimes! Always compute minimums via the product of survival functions P(T_i > t)\u2014convolution is for SUMS, not minimums.",
    "stmtKind": "WORKED EXAMPLE",
    "statement": "<b>Minimum of independent exponentials.</b> If $T_1,\\ldots,T_n$ are independent with $T_i\\sim\\mathrm{Exp}(\\lambda_i)$, then $T=\\min_iT_i\\sim\\mathrm{Exp}\\!\\left(\\sum_i\\lambda_i\\right)$, since $\\mathbb P(T\\gt t)=\\prod_ie^{-\\lambda_it}$, and $\\mathbb P(T_k=\\min_iT_i)=\\dfrac{\\lambda_k}{\\sum_i\\lambda_i}$. A series system of components with these lifetimes fails at time $T$ (Ross 5.5, 6.6).",
    "hint": "Several routes race to the stop. How long until the first one, and which route wins?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$\\mathbb P(T\\gt t)=\\prod_ie^{-\\lambda_it}$ = nobody has come yet.</strong> The first bus is later than $t$ only if every bus is; survival chances multiply.",
      "<strong>$\\mathrm{Exp}(\\sum\\lambda_i)$ = rates add.</strong> The product is $e^{-(\\sum\\lambda_i)t}$, an exponential with the summed rate: more routes, faster first arrival.",
      "<strong>$\\lambda_k/\\sum\\lambda_i$ = the winner is proportional to rate.</strong> The chance that route $k$ is first is its share of the total rate."
    ],
