    "cardNumber": "01",
    "category": "SET LIMITS",
    "highlighterClass": "highlight-cyan",
    "title": "Limsup (Infinitely Often) vs Liminf (All But Finitely Often)",
    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-31601\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"24\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">A\u2099 = late on day n</text><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-31601)\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"56\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"98\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"112\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"126\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"154\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"168\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"182\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"196\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">keeps coming back: late i.o.  \u2208 lim sup A\u2099</text><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-31601)\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"56\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"98\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"112\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"126\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"154\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"168\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"182\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"196\" cy=\"84\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"12.919999999999987\" y=\"102\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">from some day on always late: all but finitely often  \u2208 lim inf A\u2099</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">lim sup A\u2099 = \u22c2\u2099 \u22c3\u2096\u2265\u2099 A\u2096</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">(lim sup A\u2099)\u1d9c = lim inf A\u2099\u1d9c</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "Two records of days (black = late). The top one keeps returning: lim sup, late infinitely often. The bottom is late every day from some point on: lim inf. Complements swap them.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>Limsup Definition:</strong> $\\limsup_{n \\to \\infty} A_n \\triangleq \\bigcap_{n=1}^\\infty \\bigcup_{k=n}^\\infty A_k = \\{A_n \\text{ i.o.}\\}$ (infinitely often). $\\omega \\in \\limsup A_n \\iff \\omega$ belongs to infinitely many $A_n$.",
      "<strong>Liminf Definition:</strong> $\\liminf_{n \\to \\infty} A_n \\triangleq \\bigcup_{n=1}^\\infty \\bigcap_{k=n}^\\infty A_k = \\{A_n \\text{ a.b.f.o.}\\}$ (all but finitely often). $\\omega \\in \\liminf A_n \\iff \\exists N$ such that $\\omega \\in A_n$ for all $n \\ge N$.",
      "<strong>De Morgan Duality:</strong> $(\\limsup A_n)^c = \\liminf A_n^c$. Furthermore, $\\liminf A_n \\subseteq \\limsup A_n$ always holds."
    ],
    "math": "$$\\limsup_{n \\to \\infty} A_n = \\bigcap_{n=1}^\\infty \\bigcup_{k=n}^\\infty A_k = \\{A_n \\text{ i.o.}\\}, \\qquad \\left(\\limsup A_n\\right)^c = \\liminf A_n^c$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>Does the bad luck ever stop?</strong> \u201cLate infinitely often\u201d means however far into the future you look, another late day awaits. \u201cLate from some day on\u201d means a permanent breakdown starts at some point and never ends.",
    "examTrap": "Swapping intersection and union! Limsup is intersection of unions (\u22c2 \u22c3); Liminf is union of intersections (\u22c3 \u22c2). Swapping them completely reverses their mathematical meaning.",
    "stmtKind": "DEFINITION",
    "statement": "<b>Limsup and liminf of events.</b> For events $A_n$, $\\limsup A_n=\\bigcap_{n=1}^\\infty\\bigcup_{k=n}^\\infty A_k=\\{A_n\\text{ infinitely often}\\}$ and $\\liminf A_n=\\bigcup_{n=1}^\\infty\\bigcap_{k=n}^\\infty A_k=\\{A_n\\text{ for all but finitely many }n\\}$. Also $(\\limsup A_n)^c=\\liminf A_n^c$ (Grimmett 7.3; Durrett 2.3).",
    "hint": "How do you say 'late on infinitely many days' versus 'late on all but finitely many days' with unions and intersections?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$\\bigcup_{k\\ge n}A_k$ = late on some day from $n$ on.</strong> Whatever day $n$ you start from, there is still a late day ahead.",
      "<strong>$\\bigcap_n\\bigcup_{k\\ge n}A_k$ = this holds for every $n$.</strong> There is always a later late day: lateness never stops, that is, infinitely often.",
      "<strong>$\\bigcup_n\\bigcap_{k\\ge n}A_k$ = always late from some day on.</strong> Past some $n$, every day is late: all but finitely often. Complements swap the two."
    ],
