    "title": "Geometric Contrast: WLLN (Snapshots) vs SLLN (Trajectories)",
    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-31705\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"60\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">WLLN: snapshot at one n</text><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-31705)\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"/><circle cx=\"57\" cy=\"78\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"64\" cy=\"56\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"55\" cy=\"64\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"62\" cy=\"86\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"70\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"58\" cy=\"48\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"72\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"65\" cy=\"92\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">n fixed</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">SLLN: whole path after n</text><line x1=\"112\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"226\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-31705)\"/><line x1=\"112\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-31705)\"/><line x1=\"112\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"226\" y2=\"66\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><path d=\"M112.0,78.4 L115.7,81.5 L119.3,82.8 L123.0,88.4 L126.7,76.8 L130.3,83.0 L134.0,49.2 L137.7,64.9 L141.3,78.6 L145.0,69.8 L148.7,75.0 L152.3,58.3 L156.0,65.5 L159.7,62.0 L163.3,66.6 L167.0,66.9 L170.7,60.6 L174.3,63.2 L178.0,64.1 L181.7,69.3 L185.3,67.9 L189.0,63.9 L192.7,67.6 L196.3,64.2 L200.0,66.5 L203.7,64.5 L207.3,64.3 L211.0,67.1 L214.7,65.2 L218.3,65.3 L222.0,67.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">n</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">SLLN controls the whole tail \u222a\u2096\u2265\u2099 at once: a path property</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "Left: the weak law is a statement about the spread of values on one fixed day n. Right: the strong law is about a whole path, which must stay in the band for all days after n.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>WLLN Condition:</strong> $\\lim_{n \\to \\infty} \\mathbb{P}(|\\bar{X}_n - \\mu| \\ge \\epsilon) = 0$. Evaluates probability at single vertical slice $n$.",
      "<strong>SLLN Condition:</strong> $\\lim_{n \\to \\infty} \\mathbb{P}\\left(\\bigcup_{k=n}^\\infty \\{|\\bar{X}_k - \\mu| \\ge \\epsilon\\}\\right) = 0$. Evaluates the probability of ANY departure across the entire infinite future $k \\ge n$.",
      "<strong>Strict Superiority:</strong> Because $\\mathbb{P}(|\\bar{X}_n - \\mu| \\ge \\epsilon) \\le \\mathbb{P}(\\bigcup_{k=n}^\\infty \\{|\\bar{X}_k - \\mu| \\ge \\epsilon\\})$, SLLN trivially implies WLLN."
    ],
    "math": "$$\\text{WLLN}: \\mathbb{P}(|\\bar{X}_n - \\mu| \\ge \\epsilon) \\to 0, \\qquad \\text{SLLN}: \\mathbb{P}\\left(\\bigcup_{k=n}^\\infty \\{|\\bar{X}_k - \\mu| \\ge \\epsilon\\}\\right) \\to 0$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>One day versus the rest of your life.</strong> The weak law promises that on day 1000 your average is almost surely close. The strong law promises that from some day on it is close on every later day too.",
    "examTrap": "Assuming WLLN implies SLLN. Variables can satisfy WLLN while oscillating violently out of the tube infinitely many times (e.g. typewriter sequence).",
    "stmtKind": "THEOREM",
    "statement": "<b>WLLN versus SLLN.</b> The WLLN says $\\mathbb P(|\\bar X_n-\\mu|\\ge\\varepsilon)\\to0$ for each fixed $\\varepsilon$ (a statement about the law at each time $n$). The SLLN says $\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\bigcup_{k\\ge n}\\{|\\bar X_k-\\mu|\\ge\\varepsilon\\}\\bigr)\\to0$ as $n\\to\\infty$ (a statement about the whole path after $n$) (Grimmett 7.2, 7.5).",
    "hint": "What does a law about one day say, compared with a law about the whole future of a run?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$\\mathbb P(|\\bar X_n-\\mu|\\ge\\varepsilon)\\to0$ = a snapshot.</strong> On any chosen day $n$, a miss is unlikely; different days may have different unlucky runs.",
      "<strong>$\\bigcup_{k\\ge n}\\{|\\bar X_k-\\mu|\\ge\\varepsilon\\}$ = any miss from day $n$ on.</strong> The union of all later misses is the event that the path ever leaves the band again.",
      "<strong>$\\to0$ = the path stays inside.</strong> Even the chance of ever leaving the band after day $n$ goes to 0: stronger than the snapshot."
    ],
    "textbookImg": null,
