    "highlighterClass": "highlight-amber",
    "title": "Inter-Arrival & Waiting Time Distributions",
    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-32402\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"56\" x2=\"226\" y2=\"56\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"48\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"84\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"84\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"26\" y1=\"74\" x2=\"46\" y2=\"74\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"36.0\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">T\u2081</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"74\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"74\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"66.0\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">T\u2082</text><line x1=\"86\" y1=\"74\" x2=\"104\" y2=\"74\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"95.0\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">T\u2083</text><text x=\"106\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">S\u2099</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">gaps are i.i.d. Exp(\u03bb)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">S\u2099 = T\u2081 + \u2026 + T\u2099 ~ Gamma(n, \u03bb)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u2119(N(t) \u2265 n) = \u2119(S\u2099 \u2264 t)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">n buses by time t \u21d4 the n-th bus has arrived by t</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "Arrivals with the gaps T\u2081, T\u2082, T\u2083 marked. The gaps are exponential, the n-th arrival S\u2099 is a sum of n of them, and 'N(t) \u2265 n' is the same event as 'S\u2099 \u2264 t'.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>Independent Exponential Spacings:</strong> The inter-arrival times $T_k = S_k - S_{k-1}$ are independent and identically distributed exponential random variables: $T_k \\stackrel{\\text{i.i.d.}}{\\sim} \\text{Exp}(\\lambda)$ with density $f_T(t) = \\lambda e^{-\\lambda t}$ and mean $\\mathbb{E}[T_k] = 1/\\lambda$.",
      "<strong>Gamma Waiting Times:</strong> The arrival timestamp of the $n$-th event is the sum of $n$ i.i.d. exponentials: $S_n = \\sum_{k=1}^n T_k \\sim \\text{Gamma}(n, \\lambda)$ (Erlang distribution) with density $f_{S_n}(t) = \\frac{\\lambda^n t^{n-1} e^{-\\lambda t}}{(n-1)!}$ and mean $\\mathbb{E}[S_n] = n/\\lambda$.",
      "<strong>Counting-Time Duality:</strong> The fundamental event equivalence connects the discrete counting process and continuous arrival times: $\\{N(t) \\ge n\\} \\iff \\{S_n \\le t\\}$, converting tail probabilities between Poisson and Gamma distributions."
    ],
    "math": "$$T_k \\stackrel{\\text{i.i.d.}}{\\sim} \\text{Exp}(\\lambda), \\quad S_n = \\sum_{k=1}^n T_k \\sim \\text{Gamma}(n, \\lambda), \\quad P(N(t) \\ge n) = P(S_n \\le t)$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>Gaps and the n-th bus.</strong> With 6 buses an hour the typical gap is 10 minutes, and the wait for the 3rd bus is the sum of three such gaps.",
    "examTrap": "Confusing rate parameter \u03bb with scale parameter \u03b2 = 1/\u03bb! In StoMA and engineering, Exp(\u03bb) denotes rate \u03bb with mean 1/\u03bb and density \u03bb e^{-\u03bbt}, not mean \u03bb!",
    "stmtKind": "THEOREM",
    "statement": "<b>Inter-arrival and waiting times.</b> For a Poisson process of rate $\\lambda$ the inter-arrival times $T_1,T_2,\\ldots$ are i.i.d. $\\operatorname{Exp}(\\lambda)$, the $n$-th arrival time $S_n=\\sum_{k=1}^nT_k\\sim\\operatorname{Gamma}(n,\\lambda)$, and $\\mathbb P(N(t)\\ge n)=\\mathbb P(S_n\\le t)$ (Ross 5.3; Grimmett 6.8).",
    "hint": "How long do you wait between buses, and how long until the n-th one?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$T_k\\sim\\operatorname{Exp}(\\lambda)$ = memoryless gaps.</strong> Each gap between consecutive buses is exponential with mean $1/\\lambda$, independently of the others.",
      "<strong>$S_n=\\sum T_k\\sim\\operatorname{Gamma}(n,\\lambda)$ = the $n$-th arrival.</strong> A sum of $n$ independent exponential gaps.",
      "<strong>$\\mathbb P(N(t)\\ge n)=\\mathbb P(S_n\\le t)$ = two views of one event.</strong> At least $n$ buses by time $t$ iff the $n$-th has come by $t$."
    ],
