    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-32705\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"44.0\" r=\"10.0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"47\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">0</text><circle cx=\"76.0\" cy=\"44.0\" r=\"10.0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"76\" y=\"47\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">1</text><circle cx=\"118.0\" cy=\"44.0\" r=\"10.0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"47\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">2</text><circle cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"44.0\" r=\"10.0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"47\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">3</text><circle cx=\"202.0\" cy=\"44.0\" r=\"10.0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"47\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u2026</text><line x1=\"45.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"65.0\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-32705)\"/><line x1=\"65.0\" y1=\"48.0\" x2=\"45.0\" y2=\"48.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-32705)\"/><text x=\"55\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03bb</text><text x=\"55\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03bc</text><line x1=\"87.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"107.0\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-32705)\"/><line x1=\"107.0\" y1=\"48.0\" x2=\"87.0\" y2=\"48.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-32705)\"/><text x=\"97\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03bb</text><text x=\"97\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03bc</text><line x1=\"129.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"149.0\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-32705)\"/><line x1=\"149.0\" y1=\"48.0\" x2=\"129.0\" y2=\"48.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-32705)\"/><text x=\"139\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03bb</text><text x=\"139\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03bc</text><line x1=\"171.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"191.0\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-32705)\"/><line x1=\"191.0\" y1=\"48.0\" x2=\"171.0\" y2=\"48.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-32705)\"/><text x=\"181\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03bb</text><text x=\"181\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03bc</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">n people at the stop: arrivals \u03bb, service \u03bc</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">M/M/1, \u03c1 = \u03bb/\u03bc &lt; 1:  \u03c0\u2099 = (1 \u2212 \u03c1) \u03c1\u207f</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"102\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\ud835\udd3c[L] = \u03c1 / (1 \u2212 \u03c1)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">W = 1 / (\u03bc \u2212 \u03bb)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03c1 \u2192 1: both blow up</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "Queue-length ladder with arrivals at rate \u03bb and service at rate \u03bc. For \u03c1 = \u03bb/\u03bc < 1 the long-run length is geometric, mean \u03c1/(1 \u2212 \u03c1), and it explodes as \u03c1 \u2192 1.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>Continuous Birth-Death Model:</strong> A CTMC with state space $\\{0, 1, 2, \\dots\\}$ where transitions occur only between adjacent states: birth rate $q_{k, k+1} = \\lambda_k$ and death rate $q_{k, k-1} = \\mu_k$. Detailed balance gives $\\pi_k \\lambda_k = \\pi_{k+1} \\mu_{k+1}$.",
      "<strong>M/M/1 Queue Steady State:</strong> With constant arrival rate $\\lambda$ and single server rate $\\mu$, traffic intensity is $\\rho = \\lambda/\\mu \\lt  1$. Detailed balance yields $\\pi_n = \\rho^n \\pi_0$, producing the geometric distribution $\\pi_n = (1 - \\rho)\\rho^n$ with average customer backlog $\\mathbb{E}[L] = \\frac{\\rho}{1 - \\rho}$.",
      "<strong>M/M/c Multi-Server Queue:</strong> With $c$ servers, service rate scales as $\\mu_k = \\min(k, c)\\mu$. Erlang's C formula gives the probability of queuing delay: $P(\\text{Wait} > 0) = \\frac{\\frac{(c\\rho)^c}{c!(1-\\rho)}}{\\sum_{k=0}^{c-1} \\frac{(c\\rho)^k}{k!} + \\frac{(c\\rho)^c}{c!(1-\\rho)}}$ where $\\rho = \\lambda/(c\\mu) \\lt  1$."
    ],
    "math": "$$\\pi_n = (1 - \\rho)\\rho^n \\quad (\\text{M/M/1, } \\rho = \\frac{\\lambda}{\\mu} \\lt  1); \\qquad \\mathbb{E}[L] = \\frac{\\rho}{1 - \\rho}, \\qquad W = \\frac{1}{\\mu - \\lambda}$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>Why the stop clogs.</strong> If buses clear people at 6 an hour and 5 arrive an hour, the mean queue is 5 people and the mean time in the system is 1 hour. At 5.9 arrivals an hour, the queue is 59.",
    "examTrap": "Applying M/M/1 formulas when \u03c1 \u2265 1! When arrival rate \u03bb exceeds service rate \u03bc (\u03c1 \u2265 1), no stationary distribution exists, and the queue backlog explodes to +\u221e with probability 1.",
    "stmtKind": "WORKED EXAMPLE",
    "statement": "<b>M/M/1 queue.</b> Arrivals at rate $\\lambda$, service at rate $\\mu$, one server; $\\rho=\\lambda/\\mu\\lt 1$. The number in system is a birth\u2013death chain with $\\pi_n=(1-\\rho)\\rho^n$, mean $\\mathbb E[L]=\\frac\\rho{1-\\rho}$ and mean time in system $W=\\frac1{\\mu-\\lambda}$ (Little's law $L=\\lambda W$). For M/M/c, $\\rho=\\frac\\lambda{c\\mu}\\lt 1$ (Ross 8.3; Grimmett 11.2).",
    "hint": "How long is the queue at the stop in the long run, and how long do you wait?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$\\pi_n=(1-\\rho)\\rho^n$ = geometric queue length.</strong> Detailed balance $\\pi_n\\lambda=\\pi_{n+1}\\mu$ gives a geometric law, normalised by $1-\\rho$.",
      "<strong>$\\mathbb E[L]=\\frac\\rho{1-\\rho}$ = the mean queue.</strong> The mean of the geometric law; it blows up as $\\rho\\to1$.",
      "<strong>$W=\\frac1{\\mu-\\lambda}$ = the mean time in system.</strong> By Little's law $W=\\mathbb E[L]/\\lambda$; it also blows up as $\\mu-\\lambda\\to0$."
    ],
